777 0 obj
<<
/Title (Purpose: The school IT helpdesk receives many incident requests daily from students and teachers \(Wi-Fi issues, projector failures, password problems, slow computers\). IT staff currently review each request manually to identify the issue type, pick a category and subcategory, and inform the caller. This is time-consuming, error-prone and not scalable. This project automates ticket classification at the time of creation using ServiceNow Flow Designer, by analysing keywords in the ticket's short description.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 722 0 R
/Next 832 0 R
>>
endobj
